swarma-memory v0.2.2

Scanner: exact source locators (Matrix room/event, commit, sha256 digest)
are exempt from entropy checks in source fields only; named-token checks
stay everywhere; malformed Matrix session values are usage errors;
slash-joined task-id compounds no longer trip entropy_base64.
Signed by the platform release key.
